OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions continue over festival
OL,4,Amove discussions
OL,5,
OL,6,FDiscussions that led to the relocation
OL,7,Fof a popular winter festival were under
OL,8,Fway while bosses were claiming it would
OL,9,Fstill go ahead in its usual place, the
OL,10,FBBC can reveal.
OL,12,FThe Winter Droving has been held in
OL,13,FPenrith for 14 years, but last month
OL,14,Forganisers announced it would move to
OL,15,FCarlisle, sparking outrage.
OL,17,FAt the time, Eden Arts said it had been
OL,18,Fworking "until the last minute" to keep
OL,19,Fthe event in the town but financial
OL,20,Fchallenges had made it impossible.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
