OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions continue over festival
OL,4,Amove discussions
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, paperwork for the event had
OL,7,Fnot been submitted in the usual
OL,8,Ftimeframe and plans for a new Carlisle
OL,9,Fevent began in July. Eden Arts said
OL,10,Fclaims it had always been planning the
OL,11,Fmove were "not true".
